WEBVTT

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.260
It's pretty, isn't it Kanetsugu?

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.230
Yes, Kenshin-sama!

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.890
Wouldn't it be wonderful if this whole

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.520
beautiful warring states world were mine?

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.450
Wouldn't it, Kanetsugu?

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.620
Of course, if you ruled the world, 
then it would be even more...

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:25.410
Kanetsugu!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.940
K-Kenshin-sama!

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:27.720
Why?

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.610
Is breakfast ready, Kanetsugu?

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.510
Hurry!

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:34.840
Okay!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.960
I'll get it ready right away.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.720
That was good.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:45.780
You couldn't wait for me to take a shower?

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.320
Sorry, sorry.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:50.290
Your food's just so good I couldn't wait.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.680
That doesn't mean you should 
peek at me during a shower.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.390
Jeez.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.280
Kenshin-sama?

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.830
What?  That's not what I meant at all!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.590
You've got rice on your face!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.670
Kenshin-sama, are you okay on time?

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:24.110
You said you had to be 
in the studio all morning.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.360
I need to change!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:31.520
<b>Make yourself a cute girl.</b>

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:29.630
Wait, no, first makeup, no—

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.520
I need to shower first!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.260
Oh no!

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:40.240
Maybe I shouldn't have pushed her away.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.240
Kenshin \ Kanetsugu

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.790
Looking good.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.320
Good, good.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.500
Great!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.780
Okay, take a pose.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.000
Got it.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.000
Thank you all.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.600
It feels good to be in my usual outfit.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.220
Kenshin-chan, you leaving?

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.180
Oh, miss stilist!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:15.740
No, it's not stilist it's stylist.

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.550
Try to remember.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.510
But your shoot today was great.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.910
Did you get prettier?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.120
Not at all.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.580
Okay, see you.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.630
Bye.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.250
Bye.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.250
I was a little worried at first,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.350
but she's been getting a lot 
better as a model lately.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.190
But she certainly has a 
unique fashion sense.

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.930
That's what's great, silly.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:51.550
And I think yours is a lot more unique.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:56.010
I hope it doesn't start 
raining until I get back.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.050
Oh, right.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.460
Jeez...

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.390
Rock paper scissors!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.590
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.760
Yay!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.800
Aww!

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:39.440
Now a little love.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.200
Just kidding.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.440
I'm back!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.660
Welcome back, Kenshin-sama!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.570
That was a good bath.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.220
That's great!

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.330
Kenshin-sama.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.840
Why are you still dressed like that?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.710
It's not dignified.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.820
I was enjoying a post-bath beer...

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.060
The beer is fine,

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:10.390
but put your pajamas on.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.870
But the beer...

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:12.970
Kenshin-sama.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.390
Right.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.820
All the food here is good,

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.160
but this curry stuff is especially great.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:31.800
It feels different today, 
is there something special in it?

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.240
It's beef tendon curry today.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.910
I boiled the beef tendons until they were soft

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.440
and then put in a can of tomatoes.

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.320
The sourness of the tomatoes 
works surprisingly well with it.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.170
And the konnyaku gives it texture.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.040
I got the idea when I 
saw it in a beef-sinew recipe.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:53.540
And then, miso as a secret ingredient...

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.180
...and love.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.310
No, nothing!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.990
More importantly, how does it taste?

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.050
It's good.

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.560
Curry's good, but the color looks

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.500
kind of muddy, doesn't it?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:16.240
The color?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:19.200
But there are vegetables to give it color,

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.680
so it's not that big a deal, is it?

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.960
And now in horse racing news.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.930
This will be the last race 
for Triple crown winner,

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.680
Toukai Yumitori, before his retirement.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.840
Kenshin-sama, that's it!

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:40.810
W-What?

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.810
Did you see those horses?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.940
Their strong form, 
their graceful movement...

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.220
If we got those horses

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.010
and made them into a cavalry squad,

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:53.630
they'd surely be a huge help

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.560
in getting your flag to fly in the capital!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.040
Hey, Kanetsugu...

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.020
We've gotta get started!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.270
We can leave right now and...

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.320
Calm down, Kanetsugu!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.380
I don't have time to calm down.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.670
If somebody gets them first...

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:06.670
Kanetsugu.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.010
More.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.100
<b>Squid</b>

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.360
Kenshin-sama.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:36.190
It's not good to eat so 
many spicy, salty things.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.740
You need to watch your salt intake.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.330
Jeez, Kanetsugu, you're like a mom.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.890
I'm not your mom!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.380
Then what are you?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.370
What am I?  I'm...

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.720
That's weird!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:53.030
I'm your number one retainer, what else?

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:56.640
More importantly, go on and try this.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:58.230
What is this?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.800
Cream cheese and anchovies.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.190
It's good!

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:11.000
This is minced shrimp and 
edamame in a spring roll.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.170
This is good, too.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.580
And a stew!

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.010
Good!

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:16.950
Isn't it?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.740
Oh, the clouds cleared.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.950
Look, Kanetsugu.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.370
The moon.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.800
Isn't this nice?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:39.130
Every day we were there we had to fight.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.930
We never had time to look 
at the moon like this.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:46.560
I hope we can stay like this forever.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.260
Don't you think, Kanetsugu?

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:56.280
Yeah... you're right.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.950
Kanetsugu, have some.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.440
But I don't really drink.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.090
Come on, come on!

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:06.300
But...

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.640
Drinking alone is boring.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:09.600
Right?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.960
Okay, just a little.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:20.410
Um... that's enough.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:23.140
Oh, come on, just this once.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.100
If you pass out I'll take care of you.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.130
Kenshin-sama!

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.710
Kenshin-sama!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:34.340
You need to sleep on the bed!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.780
Kenshin-sama!

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.340
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.940
I'm not drunk...

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.370
You're drunk.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:45.620
You never know when to stop 
when you're drinking.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:50.750
"If you pass out, I'll take care of you."?  Hah!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.700
Now, Kenshin-sama.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.750
Kenshin-sama!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:35.040
<b>Bi</b>

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.040
What do you think?

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.670
Kenshin-sama, what is this?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.770
My new flag.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:46.260
The "Bi" character is for my god, 
Bishamonten.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:50.680
It's my dream that this flag 
someday fly in the capital.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:57.520
Kenshin-sama, please let me help make this dream come true.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.440
Kanetsugu...

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.820
I'm counting on you, Kanetsugu.

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.200
Right!

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:13.420
Kenshin-sama, I'll clear a path!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.340
Kenshin-sama!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.260
What happened?

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.290
I don't know.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.680
There was this light 
and the next thing I knew...

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:25.490
Come on, come on!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.720
We've got some good ones today!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.360
Hey, Kanetsugu-chan.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.170
Why not add one of these for dinner tonight?

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.010
Look at this!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.830
Nice color, huh?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.460
Yeah...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.180
Thanks!

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:54.790
<i>How long has it been since Kenshin-sama</i>

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.690
<i>and I came here?</i>

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.530
<i>At first, everything was so different</i>

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.470
<i>that I didn't know what to do.</i>

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:15.010
<i>As time passed we started 
getting used to everything,</i>

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.640
<i>and eventually Kenshin-sama</i>

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:19.630
<i>started to enjoy her life here.</i>

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:28.840
<i>Yes.  A peaceful life where 
she didn't have to fight.</i>

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.420
<i>But I'm different.</i>

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.680
<i>As I started to live in this world,</i>

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:40.250
<i>the color drained from my vision.</i>

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:45.780
<i>I'm sure this world is rejecting me.</i>

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:54.030
<i>To me, this world is a gray one,
 devoid of color.</i>

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.670
Kenshin-sama's back.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:07.170
Jeez, Kenshin-sama is so lazy with this stuff.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:11.340
Oh, you're back.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.240
Don't "you're back" me!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.970
You left your clothes everywhere again!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.710
Oh, sorry.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.600
Jeez.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.320
By the way, you're early today.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.540
Yeah.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.650
The shoot ended early.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.650
I see.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.990
I'll get dinner ready right away.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:38.470
K-Kenshin-sama, that... that...

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:41.830
Oh, it was close so I used it as a towel.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.840
See?

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.500
Not "see!"

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:49.090
That flag's going up in the capital someday!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.930
It's important!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.010
This is the last one we have 
since we came here!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.390
Hey, Kanetsugu.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.260
We need to take care of it.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:15:59.530
Kanetsugu.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.640
I've thought I needed to say this for a while.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.570
We have to give up on conquering the world.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:12.310
Nobody's pursuing it in this world,

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.280
and everybody's at peace.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:17.410
If we can't go back to the other world,

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.670
we need to...

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:20.490
Kenshin-sama...

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.160
Kanetsugu?

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.550
I hate you Kenshin-sama!

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.460
Kanetsugu!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.460
<b>Za- Kouenji</b>

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>My dream was to fight with Kenshin-sama</i>

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.260
<i>and raise her flag in the capital.</i>

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.230
<i>I wanted to make her dream come true.</i>

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.470
<i>To help her.</i>

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:11.070
<i>That's why I've stayed with her so long.</i>

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.720
<i>Sometimes I would make strategies with her,</i>

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.500
<i>and others spread out my wings and</i>

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.600
<i>fly over the battlefield.</i>

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:24.070
<i>But in this world, 
where she's given up on conquest,</i>

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:27.570
<i>my dream will never come true.</i>

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:38.280
<i>This is a gray world with no dreams.</i>

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.410
Kanetsugu!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.000
Wait!

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:53.970
What's wrong?

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.020
You just ran off.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:57.900
If you...

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:02.480
If you give up on your dream of conquest,

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.350
what am I supposed to do?

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.350
What are you supposed to do?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.180
My dream was to raise

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:14.240
your flag in the capital with you!

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.210
So...

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.400
So...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:20.240
If you give up on that dream,

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.940
if you stop trying to conquer,

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:27.730
then I can't do anything for you anymore!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.220
There's no point in my being by your side.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.890
There's no point?

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:34.470
You can take care of me 
like you always have,

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.830
and make me dinner!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.550
You don't need me to do that!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:46.760
This world isn't where I belong.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.900
There's no place for me here.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.010
Kanetsugu!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.690
I want to eat the food you make,

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.740
not the food anyone else makes.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.620
So come back, Kanetsugu,

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:07.870
and make yummy food for me every day!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:12.580
You belong by my side, Kanetsugu!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:21.550
Kenshin-sama!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.280
Kanetsugu!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.000
Kenshin-sama!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.180
Kenshin-sama...

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.510
I haven't seen that in a while.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.960
I'm sorry.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:10.090
I was just so happy that 
my wings came out...

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.690
Not your wings.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.860
Your real smile.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.780
Kenshin-sama...

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:31.990
Where are we?

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.670
I finally found you.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:36.920
Nobunaga.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.350
How?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.170
I'm here for your secret treasures.

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.800
Our secret treasures?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:48.560
Now, you can either hand them over,

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.690
or we fight.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.900
I don't mind.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.510
What about you, Kanetsugu?

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:56.680
Yes.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:59.070
If you're okay with it.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:03.260
Um, well, supposedly you can go back

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:06.200
to our old world if you get them...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.450
In other words, if you give them

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.960
to me you can't go back anymore—

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.080
I don't mind.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:16.260
I decided to live here in this 
world with Kenshin-sama.

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.510
That's right.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.500
That's how it is.

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:47.960
Kenshin-sama, they say the star of the

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:50.210
next episode is the
one-eyed dragon, Date Masamune.

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:53.360
I'm sure her beautiful, brown-skinned body will be kicking butt.

